e satisfying combos.    </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098610/extras/1b13decd90605843473cc0aabe3f8be3.avif?t=1751507625\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Playstyle Options</strong>: A charming and motley cast of playable characters awaits you. Whether you want to take your time carefully planning or play in the fast lane, you've got options.  <br></li><li><strong>Strange Company</strong>: <strong>Over 40 unique battle encounters</strong> include everything from toxic players and game designer moles to creative cultists and grotesque meeting blobs!</li></ul>",
